  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 cup coconut flour",
    "2 tablespoon psyllium husk powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoon coconut oil",
    "2 large egg",
    "5 tablespoon ice water"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Mix together the almond flour, coconut flour, psyllium husk powder, and salt in a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_10082.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, whisk together the eggs and let sit for a moment.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1012.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the coconut oil to the dry ingredients mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1018.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in the oil until well incorporated and sandy in consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1023.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the eggs to the bowl and mix well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1028.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly add in the ice-cold water until the dough reaches a workable consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1031.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead the dough into a ball and let sit for 5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1039.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form the ball of dough into a square and cut into sections.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1044.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Push the dough into a tart pan and work it into the grooves, keeping the crust relatively thin.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_1046.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once done, par-bake the dough for 12–15 minutes. I find that cooking the tart dough for another 20-30 minutes with filling in it does a great job, so if you don’t plan to cook the food inside of it for that long, you can par-cook it for a little bit longer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/tartshellslong.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "The crust is ready to be filled and baked in future recipes. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pie-crust/#wprm-recipe-51301-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
